msgstr "https://kfocus.org/"

#: content/hardware.md:0
msgid "Pinebook Pro"
msgstr "Pinebook Pro"

#: content/hardware.md:0
msgid ""
"The Pinebook Pro is meant to deliver solid day-to-day Linux or\n"
"*BSD experience and to be a compelling alternative to mid-ranged\n"
"Chromebooks that people convert into Linux laptops. In contrast to\n"
"most mid-ranged Chromebooks however, the Pinebook Pro comes with\n"
"an IPS 1080p 14″ LCD panel, a premium magnesium alloy shell,\n"
"64/128GB of eMMC storage, a 10,000 mAh capacity battery and the\n"
"modularity / hackability that only an open source project can\n"
"deliver – such as the unpopulated PCIe m.2 NVMe slot. The USB-C\n"
"port on the Pinebook Pro, apart from being able to transmit data\n"
"and charge the unit, is also capable of digital video output\n"
"up-to 4K at 60hz.\n"
msgstr ""
"La Pinebook Pro celas liveri solidan ĉiutagan sperton pri Linukso aŭ\n"
"*BSD kaj esti konvinka alternativo al meznivelaj\n"
"Khromebooks, kiujn homoj konvertas en Linuksajn tekkomputilojn. Kontraste "
"al\n"
"plej meznivelaj Chromebooks tamen, la Pinebook Pro venas kun\n"
"an IPS 1080p 14″ LCD-panelo, altkvalita magnezia aloja ŝelo,\n"
"64/128GB de eMMC-konservejo, 10,000 mAh-kapacita baterio kaj la\n"
"modulareco/hakebleco. ke nur malfermfonteca projekto povas\n"
"liveri - kiel ekzemple la senhoma fendo PCIe m.2 NVMe. La USB-C\n"
"pordo sur la Pinebook Pro, krom povi transdoni datumojn\n"
"ŝarĝi la unuon, ankaŭ kapablas je cifereca videa eligo\n"
"ĝis 4K je 60 hz.\n"

#: content/hardware.md:0
msgid "Pinebook pro picture"
msgstr "Pinebook pro bildo"

#: content/hardware.md:0
msgid "1080p IPS Panel"
msgstr "1080p IPS-Panelo"

#: content/hardware.md:0
