msgid ""
"The ultra-slim big-screen workstation. Perfect for 3D rendering, software\n"
"development, deep learning, and AAA gaming.\n"
msgstr ""
"La ultra-svelta grandekrana laborstacio. Perfekta por 3D bildigo, "
"programara\n"
"disvolviĝo, profunda lernado kaj AAA-ludado.\n"

